\newlabel{fig:enclosed_mass_profile}{{1.4}{3}{Enclosed mass profile $M(r)$ of the dark matter distribution in the subhalo as a function of radial distance $r$. The enclosed mass is computed via numerical integration of the density profile $\rho (r)$}{figure.caption.5}{}}
